; error: 5:16: this loop makes a slice, since how many items it gives is known only as it runs, so it needs a region: write its type, as in 'fixed xs: [int]@r = each …'
; Map-form over dynamic collection without a region is refused.
task main()
    flex n = 3
    fixed sl = each x in 0..n
        x * 2
    fi
fi
